  "hasSol": true,
  "task_html": "<div style='margin:10px 0 14px;'><iframe width='100%' style='aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;border:none;display:block;' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/m9SPKwJFRCE' title='Einsetzungsverfahren erklärt' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe></div><div style='background:#fffbeb;border:1.5px solid #fde68a;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:10px 0;'><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'><strong>Idee:</strong> Wenn eine Gleichung schon nach y (oder x) aufgel&ouml;st ist, kannst du diesen Ausdruck direkt in die andere Gleichung <em>einsetzen</em> &ndash; so bleibt nur noch eine Unbekannte &uuml;brig, die du normal ausrechnen kannst.</p></div><div style='background:#f8f8f8;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 18px;margin:12px 0;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 12px;color:#374151;'>Beispiel: &nbsp; (I) y = 2x+1 &nbsp;&nbsp; (II) 3x+y=16</p><div style='display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:8px 0;'><span style='background:#d97706;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:22px;height:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-top:2px;'>1</span><span style='font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;'>y in (II) einsetzen: &nbsp; 3x + <span style='background:#fef3c7;color:#d97706;font-weight:700;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;'>(2x+1)</span> = 16<br>Vereinfacht: &nbsp; <strong>5x + 1 = 16</strong></span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:8px 0;'><span style='background:#d97706;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:22px;height:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-top:2px;'>2</span><span style='font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;'>Isolieren: &nbsp; 5x+1=16 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; 5x=15 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; <strong>x = 3</strong></span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:8px 0;'><span style='background:#d97706;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:22px;height:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-top:2px;'>3</span><span style='font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;'>x = 3 in (I) einsetzen: &nbsp; y = 2&middot;3+1 = <strong>7</strong></span></div><div style='background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:6px;padding:6px 12px;margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;'>&#x2713; L&ouml;sung: <strong>(3&nbsp;|&nbsp;7)</strong> &nbsp; Probe in (II): 3&middot;3+7 = 16 &#x2713;</div></div><hr style='margin:16px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid #ddd;'><p style='font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin:8px 0;'>Jetzt du! Aufgaben A und B f&uuml;hren dich durch jeden Schritt &ndash; Aufgabe C l&ouml;st du eigenst&auml;ndig.</p><div style='background:#eff6ff;border:1.5px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:10px 0 6px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 2px;color:#1e3a8a;'>Aufgabe A</p><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'>(I)&nbsp;y = x+3 &nbsp;&nbsp; (II)&nbsp;2x+y = 9</p></div><div style='font-size:13px;padding:2px 0 8px;'><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;'>1</span><span style='line-height:1.9;'>y in (II) einsetzen: &nbsp; 2x + <span style='background:#fef3c7;color:#d97706;font-weight:700;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'>(x+3)</span> = 9<br>Vereinfacht: &nbsp; <input class='cell-input' style='width:40px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;' data-ans='3' placeholder='?'>x + 3 = 9</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;'>2</span><span>Isolieren: &nbsp; 3x = <input class='cell-input' style='width:55px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;' data-ans='6' placeholder='?'></span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;'>3</span><span>x = <input class='cell-input' style='width:55px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;' data-ans='2' placeholder='?'></span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;'>4</span><span>y = x+3 = <input class='cell-input' style='width:55px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;' data-ans='5' placeholder='?'></span></div></div><div style='background:#eff6ff;border:1.5px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:14px 0 6px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 2px;color:#1e3a8a;'>Aufgabe B</p><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'>(I)&nbsp;y = x+2 &nbsp;&nbsp; (II)&nbsp;3x+y = 18</p></div><div style='font-size:13px;padding:2px 0 8px;'><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;'>1</span><span style='line-height:1.9;'>y in (II) einsetzen: &nbsp; 3x + <span style='background:#fef3c7;color:#d97706;font-weight:700;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'>(x+2)</span> = 18<br>Vereinfacht: &nbsp; <input class='cell-input' style='width:40px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;' data-ans='4' placeholder='?'>x + 2 = 18</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;'>2</span><span>Isolieren: &nbsp; 4x = <input class='cell-input' style='width:55px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;' data-ans='16' placeholder='?'></span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;'>3</span><span>x = <input class='cell-input' style='width:55px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;' data-ans='4' placeholder='?'></span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;'>4</span><span>y = x+2 = <input class='cell-input' style='width:55px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;' data-ans='6' placeholder='?'></span></div></div><div style='background:#eff6ff;border:1.5px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:14px 0 6px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 2px;color:#1e3a8a;'>Aufgabe C</p><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'>(I)&nbsp;y = 2x&minus;1 &nbsp;&nbsp; (II)&nbsp;x+y = 8</p></div><p style='font-size:13px;color:#374151;margin:6px 0 10px;line-height:1.6;'>L&ouml;se jetzt vollst&auml;ndig eigenst&auml;ndig mit dem Einsetzungsverfahren. Notiere alle Rechenschritte auf einem Zettel &ndash; trage hier nur das Ergebnis ein.</p><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:4px;'><span style='font-size:13px;'>x = <input class='cell-input' style='width:60px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;' data-ans='3' placeholder='?'></span><span style='font-size:13px;'>y = <input class='cell-input' style='width:60px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;' data-ans='5' placeholder='?'></span></div><div class='check-bar'><button class='btn-check' onclick='checkStation(5)'>&#x2713; &Uuml;berpr&uuml;fen</button><button class='btn-reset' onclick='resetStation(5)'>&#x21BA; Zur&uuml;cksetzen</button><span class='check-result' id='check-result-5'></span></div>",
  "sol_html": "<p style='font-size:14px;line-height:2;'><strong>Aufgabe A:</strong> &nbsp; 3x+3=9 &rarr; 3x=<strong>6</strong> &rarr; x=<strong>2</strong> &rarr; y=2+3=<strong>5</strong> &nbsp; &check; (2|5)<br><strong>Aufgabe B:</strong> &nbsp; 4x+2=18 &rarr; 4x=<strong>16</strong> &rarr; x=<strong>4</strong> &rarr; y=4+2=<strong>6</strong> &nbsp; &check; (4|6)<br><strong>Aufgabe C:</strong> &nbsp; 3x&minus;1=8 &rarr; 3x=9 &rarr; x=<strong>3</strong> &rarr; y=2&middot;3&minus;1=<strong>5</strong> &nbsp; &check; (3|5)</p>",
  "mandatory": false
}
